Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1080
Set Height 660
Set Padding 28
Set BorderRadius 0
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.85
Output "assets/demo.gif"

Type "./eject-doctor.zsh --version"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./eject-doctor.zsh list"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "./eject-doctor.zsh sample"
Enter
Sleep 8s
